[00:22.470]Christmas night, another fight
[00:26.020]Tears we cried, a flood
[00:29.720]Got all kinds of poison in
[00:33.230]Of poison in my blood
[00:37.090]I took my feet to Oxford street
[00:40.750]Trying to right a wrong
[00:44.220]Just walk away, those windows say
[00:47.800]But I can't believe she's gone
[00:51.680]When you're still waiting for the snow to fall
[00:55.330]Doesn't really feel like Christmas at all
[01:12.640]Up above candles on air flicker
[01:16.220]Oh they flicker and they float
[01:20.170]And I'm up here holding on to all those chandeliers of hope
[01:27.100]Like some drunken Elvis singing
[01:30.570]I go singing out of tune
[01:34.530]Singing how I always loved you darling
[01:38.680]And I always will
[01:41.990]But when you're still waiting for the snow to fall
[01:46.150]Doesn't really feel like Christmas at all
[01:50.180]Still waiting for the snow to fall
[01:53.490]It doesn't really feel like Christmas at all
[02:12.770]Those Christmas Lights
[02:17.030]Light up the street
[02:19.780]Down where the sea and city meet
[02:25.670]May all your troubles soon be gone
[02:31.610]Ohh Christmas Lights keep shining on
[02:37.520]Those Christmas Lights
[02:40.630]Light up the street
[02:43.410]Maybe they'll bring her back to me
[02:49.110]Then all my troubles will be gone
[02:55.130]Ohh Christmas Lights keep shining on
[03:13.290]Oh
[03:24.840]Ohh Christmas Lights
[03:28.570]Light up the streets
[03:31.400]Light up the fireworks in me
[03:37.230]May all your troubles soon be gone
[03:43.900]Those Christmas Lights keep shining on
